flowchart TB
  I[Stored cluster offsets, codes and IDs] --> J[Open selected cluster ranges]
  Q[Prepared query and score table] --> S[Score each eligible document]
  J --> S
  S --> H[Update the top-R heap]
  H --> N{More eligible rows?}
  N -->|Yes| S
